                "metadata": {
                    "note": "Marketplace",
                    "author": "Young Folkies",
                    "category": "music",
                    "description": "\"Will You Sing with Me?\" is the second album from Marisa Levenson of Young Folkies. It's composed of 8 original children's songs about important topics such as kindness and climate change/global warming and notable figures such as Princess Diana and children's singer, Raffi. Collaborators include artists from all over the world such as New Zealand-based Claudia Robin Gunn, UK-based Becky, Boris and the Beats and Marcus Ramtohul, and Canada-based Gina Lam (Ginalina).",
